  dialogText: {fileID: 7231431879909818989}
  dialogs:
  - On the left you will see Niagara Falls.
  - 'Located on the border of Ontario, Canada, and New York, USA, '
  - It is renowned worldwide for its immense volume of roaring water.
  - Once you are done exploring the dramatic mist of the falls,
  - Head up to the small cave to test your geography skills.
